WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.203 --> 00:00:00.993
- [Gary] You know what, guys?

00:00:00.993 --> 00:00:02.331
I want to say 
something right now.

00:00:02.331 --> 00:00:04.653
Getting a little bit 
on a bigger plane.

00:00:04.653 --> 00:00:08.882
What's happening right now
is the small minority of people

00:00:08.882 --> 00:00:12.623
that are mad and angry and 
hateful and dark are

00:00:12.623 --> 00:00:16.054
much louder than the 
big percentage of us

00:00:16.054 --> 00:00:19.903
that are happy and 
excited and feel great.

00:00:19.903 --> 00:00:21.674
And because the 
way technology works

00:00:21.674 --> 00:00:24.304
they are much louder than 
they've ever been before.

00:00:24.304 --> 00:00:26.164
If you leave with anything,
for any of us

00:00:26.164 --> 00:00:29.193
please, please take on this
sense of responsibility

00:00:29.193 --> 00:00:31.793
that if you've got good 
and you feel good

00:00:31.793 --> 00:00:34.203
to start sharing that 
content as well

00:00:34.203 --> 00:00:36.513
because the world 
needs more of it.

00:00:36.513 --> 00:00:38.396
(hip hop music)

